    "name": "Project Windfall",
    "steam_appid": 2804910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever since the beginning of the Great War, a lot of things had changed in the provinces Lyare once knew...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a captivating story of desire and betrayal, and discover all that the realm of Altheris has to offer. Traverse a vast open-world, complete quests, solve puzzles, master challenging trials, and gather useful resources scattered throughout the landscape. Prepare to embark on an adventure like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804910/extras/79d0a2705dd3aaa89f4d500b5f3a8ce8.avif?t=1755433772\" data-has-big width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The six provinces of Altheris are both beautiful and dangerous. Use your arsenal to fight your way through open plains, dark caves, and to the tops of high mountains. Lyare is adept with a wide variety of weapons. Swords, bows, and even polearms - with the right equipment, no enemy will dare to stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804910/extras/9f4c8c1cab5bda984de3df78ecf262f5.avif?t=1755433772\" data-has-big width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect &amp; Gather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every adventurer needs supplies. Gather items and resources of varying rarity and quality by using the right tools. Venture out into the region and mine for ore, collect wood, loot enemies, or simply explore your surroundings. There's plenty to be found, and it's all yours to take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804910/extras/bd9bfb6820f279355108d97f541db824.avif?t=1755433772\" data-has-big width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The harsh times on the battlefield have made Lyare a very skilled craftswoman. With the right materials, you can craft and refine tools, weapons and armor, as well as create useful potions and cook delicious meals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804910/extras/87e297988b6e0a779fe16ae9886308b0.avif?t=1755433772\" data-has-big width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though the conflict against the Servants of Darkness is still ongoing, trade remains a profitable endeavor. Use your hard-earned gold to stock up on supplies and equipment. You may even be able to turn a profit...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804910/extras/b37489632c5acb69990dc9baf6526e2b.avif?t=1755433772\" data-has-big width=1560 height=520 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever since the beginning of the Great War, a lot of things had changed in the provinces Lyare once knew...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a captivating story of desire and betrayal, and discover all that the realm of Altheris has to offer. Traverse a vast open-world, complete quests, solve puzzles, master challenging trials, and gather useful resources scattered throughout the landscape. Prepare to embark on an adventure like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804910/extras/79d0a2705dd3aaa89f4d500b5f3a8ce8.avif?t=1755433772\" data-has-big width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The six provinces of Altheris are both beautiful and dangerous. Use your arsenal to fight your way through open plains, dark caves, and to the tops of high mountains. Lyare is adept with a wide variety of weapons. Swords, bows, and even polearms - with the right equipment, no enemy will dare to stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804910/extras/9f4c8c1cab5bda984de3df78ecf262f5.avif?t=1755433772\" data-has-big width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect &amp; Gather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every adventurer needs supplies. Gather items and resources of varying rarity and quality by using the right tools. Venture out into the region and mine for ore, collect wood, loot enemies, or simply explore your surroundings. There's plenty to be found, and it's all yours to take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804910/extras/bd9bfb6820f279355108d97f541db824.avif?t=1755433772\" data-has-big width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The harsh times on the battlefield have made Lyare a very skilled craftswoman. With the right materials, you can craft and refine tools, weapons and armor, as well as create useful potions and cook delicious meals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804910/extras/87e297988b6e0a779fe16ae9886308b0.avif?t=1755433772\" data-has-big width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though the conflict against the Servants of Darkness is still ongoing, trade remains a profitable endeavor. Use your hard-earned gold to stock up on supplies and equipment. You may even be able to turn a profit...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804910/extras/b37489632c5acb69990dc9baf6526e2b.avif?t=1755433772\" data-has-big width=1560 height=520 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Project Windfall is an anime-styled, open-world, third-person, action RPG. A great threat has arisen in the realm of Altheris. Follow the fateful journey of Lyare Van Windfall - the charismatic noble's daughter of the esteemed House Windfall - and stand against the forces of darkness.",
